OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor shares how books have
OL,4,A'magical way' of reaching you when
OL,5,Astruggling
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said it would be a chance to connect
OL,8,Fwith his fans and hopefully inspire
OL,9,Fyounger readers to experience the joy
OL,10,Fand healing of reading without the
OL,11,F"nonsense snobbery" that society puts
OL,12,Fon it.
OL,14,FHaig said he had ADHD and struggled
OL,15,Fwith school, and at the time found
OL,16,Fhimself "on the cusp of stopping
OL,17,Freading for life" because he thought he
OL,18,Fwas the type of person "that shouldn't
OL,19,Fbe reading".
